// i* Scenario — one satisfaction snapshot ("object diagram") of generic_example.istar.
//
// T2 fires -> OR-refines G1 -> G1 fulfilled -> "make" contributes Q1 -> Q1 becomes true.
// T8 fires alone -> G3 needs BOTH T1 and T8 (AND-refinement) -> stays unfulfilled.
